ReportStars←{
   ⍝ Bright visible star legend matching book example, for width ⍺
   ⍝ Format: NAME ALT AZ  x  y — packed across full width
    bright←Data.BRIGHT∧⍵.StarsVisible
    n←+/bright
    n=0: 0⍴⊂''
    names←bright/Data.STARNAMES
    coord←(⍵.StarsVisible/Data.BRIGHT)⌿⍵.StarCoord
    aa←⍵.BrightStarsAA
    entry←{
        alt az←⌊0.5+aa[⍵;]
        mx my←0.01×⌊0.5+100×coord[⍵;]
        (¯10↑⊃names[⍵]),(¯4↑⍕alt),(¯5↑⍕az),(¯7↑⍕mx),(¯6↑⍕my)
    }
   ⍝ Entries per line, as in the book, allowing 31 characters for each
    ncols←1⌈⌊⍺÷31
    (⊂''),{∊entry¨⍵}¨(1+⌊(¯1+⍳n)÷ncols)⊆⍳n }
